HDL Studio includes code derived from the following projects.

- DigitalJS (https://github.com/tilk/digitaljs): the simulator's cell
  semantics (crates/hdlstudio-sim), the schematic's cell geometry and gate
  symbols (view/schematic/cells.ts), the transform passes
  (crates/hdlstudio-yosys/src/transform.rs).
- yosys2digitaljs (https://github.com/tilk/yosys2digitaljs): the netlist
  converter (crates/hdlstudio-yosys).
- digitaljs_lua (https://github.com/tilk/digitaljs_lua): the Lua API
  (crates/hdlstudio/src/lua.rs).
- 3vl/4vl (https://github.com/tilk/3vl): the 4-valued vectors
  (crates/hdlstudio-logic).
- wavecanvas (https://github.com/tilk/wavecanvas): the waveform drawing
  (view/schematic/waves.ts).

